  "name": "Cortex",
  "description": "Cortex is a multi-tenant, subscription-based AI customer support and conversational commerce platform that lets businesses embed a RAG-powered chatbot over their business knowledge and product catalog into their websites. This repository contains the ASP.NET Core (.NET 10) Clean Architecture backend (Domain, Application, Infrastructure, Api) with EF Core on PostgreSQL, JWT authentication, Google OAuth, and Brevo email verification.",
